Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.58,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&\fs40}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.79,0:00:09.29,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I'm a soldier - that means I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.49,0:00:12.69,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Both a defendant and the judge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.49,0:00:18.09,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I am standing on both ends of the flame
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.77,0:00:22.87,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Rounding curves
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.07,0:00:25.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Overtaking life and death,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.77,0:00:31.67,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I run and fight with false shadows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.97,0:00:38.27,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,No matter how many threads of\Ndeception are woven together,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.67,0:00:46.17,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,The truth shall illuminate\Nthe face of light
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.17,0:00:49.97,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save your tears for the day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.27,0:00:53.27,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,When our pain is far behind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.67,0:00:56.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,On your feet, come with me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.57,0:00:59.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We are soldiers stand or die
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.07,0:01:02.97,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save your fears, take your place
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.17,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save them for the judgement day
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.47,0:01:09.37,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Fast and free, follow me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.67,0:01:14.67,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Time to make the sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.87,0:01:20.47,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We rise or fall
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.89,0:01:39.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This type of outcome
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.99,0:01:42.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,isn't like you at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.19,0:01:45.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I have nothing to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.79,0:01:51.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It was still too early to test rookies \N in a real combat situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.19,0:01:57.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why not try to put Yano-kun's\Nmemories into a cyberbrain?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.19,0:01:58.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Wouldn't he revive?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.09,0:02:01.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Ghosts cannot be reproduced.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.29,0:02:03.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even if you copy memories,\Nthe old ghost wouldn't inhabit them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.69,0:02:08.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If we are just trying to maintain Section 9,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.99,0:02:11.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,we may not need new members.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.09,0:02:14.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However, considering how\Nthings might be in the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.89,0:02:18.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,we must find a safe way to train recruits.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.89,0:02:20.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's true,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.19,0:02:22.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but I'm still removing Azuma from this operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.39,0:02:24.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.44,0:02:30.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Please treat him with respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.44,0:02:31.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.90,0:02:43.34,Sign - Copy,,650,0,550,,{\b1}Turmoil at the \N Northern Extremity{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.97,0:02:57.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This information came from an old friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.47,0:03:02.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A former Russian army officer, Boris\NJablov, who has now turned mafioso,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.07,0:03:08.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and several of his men have\Ntaken plutonium out of Russia
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.17,0:03:10.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,into Ostrov Iturup.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.57,0:03:18.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So you think Kuze intends to buy that plutonium?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.67,0:03:22.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You think he's going nuclear to\Ndeclare an independent state?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.47,0:03:25.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's not like him; it's too rash.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.37,0:03:32.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,One of Kuze's cyborgs killed the agent\Nwho was conducting the investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.77,0:03:34.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,At the moment, we don't know where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.67,0:03:40.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's been two hours since the agent was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.57,0:03:43.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.87,0:03:47.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's not like we have any choices left, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.67,0:03:49.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.87,0:03:56.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So, how will we figure out\Nthe location of the plutonium?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.87,0:03:59.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Rushing over to Ostrov Iturup without\Na clue isn't going to do any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.17,0:04:03.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There may be a hint in the\Ninformation we got from Public Safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.17,0:04:05.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It seems Sagawa Electronics
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.37,0:04:08.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,is expanding the Bertalrek underground\Nfactory without permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.07,0:04:10.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Bertalrek...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.77,0:04:12.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Where the Russian submarine base\Nwas located in Ostrov Iturup?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.07,0:04:13.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If I recall correctly,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.07,0:04:18.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,before withdrawing, the Russian military\Ndetonated the base and buried it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.57,0:04:19.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.47,0:04:23.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If Sagawa's construction has\Nbeen going smoothly since then,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.57,0:04:26.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,they should have reached the base by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.17,0:04:26.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.97,0:04:27.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's suspect, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.07,0:04:31.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A submarine base would be an ideal\Nlocation to hide a camouflaged ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.97,0:04:33.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But there is no proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.17,0:04:38.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If there is a deal that big being planned,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.27,0:04:40.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the local informants will have got wind of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.17,0:04:45.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Chief, we'll go straight\Nto Ostrov Iturup from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.87,0:04:50.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Please ask the Coast Guard to\Nlock down Dejima, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.27,0:04:52.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If the refugees go nuclear,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.17,0:04:53.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,everything's going to fly apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.30,0:04:55.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.60,0:04:58.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I have faith in all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.60,0:05:00.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If we do not get Kuze now,\Nthe things the Cabinet
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.64,0:05:03.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Intelligence Agency has done\Nwill fade into the background.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.10,0:05:04.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and the military will intervene.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.30,0:05:07.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We must not let Dejima turn into a war zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.96,0:05:19.41,Dialogue,,875,0,195,,{\b1\i1}Houeimaru{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.17,0:05:15.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.67,0:05:17.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.67,0:05:19.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There don't seem to be any traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.17,0:05:23.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We have time until the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.47,0:05:24.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Keep watch in shifts and get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.37,0:05:26.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.83,0:05:40.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, why don't you eat this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.31,0:05:51.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Are you really all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.91,0:05:53.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It tastes bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.81,0:05:55.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No, really, it tastes like crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.61,0:05:57.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll have to say something\Nabout this to the Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.81,0:05:59.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There's still some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.91,0:06:02.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Want to test your cyberbrain activity?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.70,0:06:04.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.70,0:06:09.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I just got thrown off by\Nthe size of Kuze's delusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.20,0:06:11.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's what I don't get.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.80,0:06:14.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What kind of delusion does he have, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.30,0:06:18.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Put in exaggerated terms,\Nworld domination, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.80,0:06:19.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.40,0:06:22.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Talk about a megalomaniac.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.30,0:06:25.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You usually wouldn't be\Naffected by something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.80,0:06:31.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Damn it, you look just like\Nsome kid who's met "the one".
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.10,0:06:32.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.52,0:06:35.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well, now we know this for sure:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.62,0:06:39.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He initially showed symptoms of\Nthe Individual Eleven virus,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.62,0:06:44.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but his actions are now fuelled by\Nqualities and ideas he already had.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.02,0:06:48.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even though his delusion itself is common,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.82,0:06:50.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the reason I couldn't laugh it off
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.82,0:06:55.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,was that he truly believes his becoming\Na dictator would bring world peace...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.62,0:06:57.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,or so it seemed to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.62,0:07:01.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In addition, his adrenaline secretion levels\Nwould be lethal to the average person,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.62,0:07:05.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We should already consider Kuze...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.72,0:07:08.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to believe himself to be on holy ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.82,0:07:10.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What do you mean by "holy ground"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.72,0:07:12.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,As in, he's turned into a self-proclaimed prophet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.52,0:07:17.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Historically speaking,\Nsuch people exhibit unbelievable strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.92,0:07:20.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Che Guevara, Malcolm X,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.92,0:07:23.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and Cassius Clay would be representative examples.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.72,0:07:25.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How are they different from Hitler?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.42,0:07:27.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In a way, they're the same species,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.52,0:07:30.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but ideologically speaking, they're closer\Nto Gandhi or Martin Luther King, Jr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.82,0:07:33.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The refugees are connected continuously
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.02,0:07:37.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to Kuze through a network that\Nhas active zoning and filtering,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.12,0:07:39.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and they're high on a live feed of his actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.52,0:07:44.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But they won't influence him and\Ntry to share his consciousness
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.22,0:07:47.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,because they know that the area\Nbeyond his ghostline is a kill zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.32,0:07:51.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So, it was a close call for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.95,0:07:57.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Not funny at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.02,0:08:29.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Ishikawa, Pazu and Bomer: stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.02,0:08:32.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Prepare for the possibility that the deal\Nis taking place in a different location.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.22,0:08:33.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.08,0:09:01.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Die, you militarist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.34,0:09:11.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This is a dangerous place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.64,0:09:13.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even though it's been returned to Japan,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.44,0:09:16.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the friction between the Russians and the\NJapanese won't disappear that quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.82,0:09:28.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.32,0:09:31.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This is a geofront in construction, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.82,0:09:35.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So that means if we go towards the base in\Nhere, we may be able to find Kuze.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.02,0:09:38.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If we're lucky, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.52,0:09:39.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,And if we don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.42,0:09:44.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In that case, we'll just end up face-to-face\Nwith Sagawa's construction workers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.62,0:09:47.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We don't have time to wait\Nfor the Major to contact us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.52,0:09:53.77,Dialogue,,875,0,200,,{\b1\i1}Houeimaru{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.91,0:10:00.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.61,0:10:04.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I came on this ship because I\Nheard we were going to buy weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.41,0:10:08.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But if I'd known that you were\Nthe one leading this operation,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.31,0:10:09.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I wouldn't have come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.91,0:10:10.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.21,0:10:13.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Then you don't have to come\Nalong if you don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.41,0:10:14.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You can go back,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.01,0:10:17.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,or disappear into the city of Ostrov Iturup.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.21,0:10:18.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I won't force you either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.62,0:10:20.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm for the revolution, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.72,0:10:24.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But it was the legend {\i1}Densetsu{\i0} who first\Ntaught us about the revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.92,0:10:28.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Now, almost everyone in Dejima\Nknows about Comrade Kuze,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.92,0:10:32.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but almost no one knows your true identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.42,0:10:34.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's why I'm not able to convince myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.96,0:10:41.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm still willing to become a suicide bomber,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.36,0:10:43.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,just like the legend taught us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.46,0:10:45.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.36,0:10:48.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Suicide is just self-gratification.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.36,0:10:52.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A revolution cannot exist without ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.76,0:10:54.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's why I want to know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.96,0:10:58.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Give me a reason to believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.96,0:11:04.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If not...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.76,0:11:11.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.86,0:11:21.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The weapon we're trying to\Nobtain today is plutonium.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.36,0:11:27.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I will use it to force the Japanese government\Nto acknowledge Dejima as an independent nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.00,0:11:36.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Return what you borrowed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.20,0:11:37.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's common decency, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.30,0:11:39.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Get it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.30,0:11:40.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Looks like your business is booming.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.20,0:11:44.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So, what goods do you have\Nthat you can lend people?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.70,0:11:46.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Oh, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.80,0:11:47.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So you remember me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.70,0:11:51.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Is the rumour that Chlordane is\Nstill doing business back there...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.69,0:11:52.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,true?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.89,0:11:54.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.29,0:11:55.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This way, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.69,0:12:02.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He's as cautious as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.68,0:12:08.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Now, this way please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.38,0:12:10.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Togusa, you wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.88,0:12:11.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.38,0:12:13.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You can go back now as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.58,0:12:17.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In this world, solicitous people aren't liked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.57,0:12:29.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You must have a lot of trouble dealing with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.17,0:12:32.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If you don't stay friends with her,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.67,0:12:34.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,you'll regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.60,0:12:51.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Chlordane, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.70,0:12:54.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You were helpful in the Nemuro invasion...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.37,0:13:00.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Offensive firewall...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.84,0:13:07.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He got burned moments ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.44,0:13:10.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I wonder where he was diving when it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.44,0:13:30.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So he was still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.54,0:13:35.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Still, he must be pretty skilled to have\Nburned a hacker of Chlordane's calibre.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.84,0:13:40.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The way they used an offensive firewall is illegal\Nunder the Confidential Information Protection Act.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.34,0:13:48.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.83,0:13:55.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A floppy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.33,0:13:58.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I can't believe he's using such\Noutdated media for his external memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.93,0:14:01.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That agent must've been having\Ntrouble dealing with these.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.50,0:14:08.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sagawa's true ledger, with the real figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.40,0:14:11.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"On sale: Lemon cake, 20 kilograms."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:13.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"Lemon cake"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.10,0:14:19.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"Half a million dollars per\Nkilo, MAU withdraws from deal."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.10,0:14:23.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"Brokers: Sagawa K, BJ.\N20 kilograms of lemon cake."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.90,0:14:26.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"K takes 40% as retirement pay."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.40,0:14:29.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"Buyer introduced by BP."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.75,0:14:35.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Just as I speculated, he'd been tapping\Ninto information on the plutonium deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.85,0:14:37.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Who's Sagawa's "K"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.35,0:14:40.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It must be Northern Special\NDivision Chief Kagazaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.55,0:14:45.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He became the middleman and sold the\Ngoods for half a million dollars per kilo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.15,0:14:48.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The seller is Boris Jablov.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.75,0:14:52.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The buyer... is "Asian BP"...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.95,0:14:54.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the Asian refugees?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.95,0:14:56.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Then, that hacker would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.65,0:15:02.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Seems Kagazaki's share is in yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.78,0:15:07.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The prepayment is already deposited to Sagawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.58,0:15:10.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Two hundred forty million yen?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.28,0:15:13.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How can the refugees have that kind of money?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.88,0:15:15.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Did Kuze get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.48,0:15:18.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But if so, how...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.79,0:15:21.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Still, this helps.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.51,0:15:31.98,Dialogue,,0,0,400,,{\i1\b1}Cabinet Intelligence Agency \N Unofficial Investigation Report{\i0\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.29,0:15:25.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I remember how you said that Sagawa Electronics\Nwas your least favourite Japanese company.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.19,0:15:33.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.89,0:15:38.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You shouldn't have quit your job\Nwith the Press Agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.19,0:15:43.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If you hadn't, the Cabinet Intelligence\NAgency might have been a better institution.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.19,0:15:49.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Ishikawa, the deal is taking place\Nat the nuclear submarine base.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.39,0:15:52.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There is a possibility that the Cabinet\NIntelligence Agency is involved this time as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.19,0:15:53.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.19,0:15:55.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There's no time to explain.\NWhere are Batou and his men?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.29,0:15:56.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They've already entered deep water.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.69,0:15:58.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Their comm systems are already cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.55,0:15:59.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll go over right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.41,0:16:13.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's almost time. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.51,0:16:15.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Tell me one more thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.41,0:16:20.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've heard that to buy plutonium,\Nyou need at least a quarter million dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.31,0:16:23.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What are you going to do about that money?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.31,0:16:25.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Are you going to dupe the Russians?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.21,0:16:28.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No, we'll pay them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.51,0:16:33.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I have made all normal citizens,\Nwho get rich on the labour of refugees,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.41,0:16:34.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,donate just a little bit to us,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.81,0:16:35.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in order for them to understand our pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.71,0:16:39.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well, it's not like you\Nwould understand what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.41,0:16:41.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This is how it works:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.64,0:16:47.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the citizens of this country, who remain\Nunaware of their privileged lifestyles,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.64,0:16:49.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,have combined total assets in savings\Nthat easily surpass 900 trillion yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.14,0:16:53.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Of course, they are also\Nunaware of this amount itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.64,0:16:57.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Did you know that there is an\Namount that doesn't officially exist
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.54,0:17:00.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,within the interest this money generates?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.64,0:17:03.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Doesn't officially exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.34,0:17:06.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Amounts under one yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.54,0:17:10.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Numbers coming after the decimal point
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.64,0:17:12.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,that normally aren't even\Ndisplayed in computer data.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.24,0:17:19.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Just by taking that small\Namount from online accounts
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.25,0:17:21.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,you get tens of millions per day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.55,0:17:27.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I created a program that would deposit\Nthat amount into my fictional bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.30,0:17:30.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I prepared the money from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.20,0:17:33.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The Japanese people have no idea
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.30,0:17:36.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,that their accounts have money\Nin sums beyond the decimal point.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.70,0:17:41.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The banks also now have AIs manage accounts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.50,0:17:45.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Refugees get taxed if they work in Japan,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.50,0:17:48.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but they will never be allowed to naturalise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.80,0:17:51.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,As for the Japanese,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.50,0:17:54.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,they don't even notice that the\Nsystem is heavily exploiting them
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.50,0:17:58.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and just consume information that\Nthey find easy to stomach and digest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.30,0:18:01.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Their society's such a fraud.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.80,0:18:03.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I would like to enlighten\Nthem about things like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.90,0:18:09.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Just how much of that money is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.70,0:18:11.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roughly,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.60,0:18:14.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,10 billion 760 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.80,0:18:17.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This will be the amount we can use as\Nmilitary funding in our revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.20,0:18:19.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Incredible...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.40,0:18:21.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Just who are you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.30,0:18:25.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm just a terrorist.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.80,0:18:26.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Though right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.60,0:18:30.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm a bit high on heroism.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.08,0:18:34.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Stay here...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.56,0:18:39.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and make sure this ship can leave at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.66,0:18:41.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.76,0:18:57.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So this is the contested expansion sector.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.76,0:18:58.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.56,0:19:00.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What's happening today?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.16,0:19:03.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I sure hope you guys have permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.16,0:19:04.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Are you the supervisor here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.56,0:19:06.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, you said "again", didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.86,0:19:07.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.06,0:19:10.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Just a while ago,\Ntwo of our armour suits went down,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.86,0:19:14.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and before that, a suspicious\Nlooking Russian cyborg went down
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.56,0:19:18.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,with two huge suitcases.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.30,0:19:19.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Do we have a winner?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.10,0:19:19.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.20,0:19:21.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But why is the GSDF here...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.93,0:19:44.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why is it just you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.93,0:19:49.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Both Jablov and Kagazaki are\Nbeing watched by Public Safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.33,0:19:52.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's why I came alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.93,0:19:59.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let's get this deal over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.93,0:20:02.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.83,0:20:06.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The record of the deposit to the\Nspecified account is in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.53,0:20:08.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Confirm it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.88,0:20:22.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.98,0:20:24.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You guys, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.54,0:20:42.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The deal's now final.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.64,0:20:45.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Neither of us can confirm what's inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.99,0:21:25.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Throw down your weapons and come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.79,0:21:28.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You're under arrest for suspicion\Nof violating weapons-proliferation
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.23,0:21:30.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,laws and illegal trafficking\Nof nuclear substances!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.85,0:21:36.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Show yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.70,0:22:02.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Saitou, something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.90,0:22:04.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Forget about this place and go get Coyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.50,0:22:05.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.99,0:22:10.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.29,0:22:11.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm getting out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.99,0:22:13.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Make sure you get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.02,0:22:22.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.92,0:22:24.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Kuze!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.82,0:22:28.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Put that down!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.72,0:22:35.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why didn't you open fire immediately?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.62,0:22:37.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Is it because you know what this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.52,0:22:38.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I don't care about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.32,0:22:41.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm aiming for a head shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.92,0:22:44.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I don't think you'll manage to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.00,0:22:47.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hurry, take the case to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.30,0:22:49.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.10,0:22:50.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.80,0:22:53.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Are you shittin' me, you bastard?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.81,0:23:10.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Finding out a galaxy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.01,0:23:14.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,of planets and stars within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.11,0:23:17.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Listening to each of them
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.01,0:23:21.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,singing the same silent melody.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.86,0:23:25.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've never seen such beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.76,0:23:28.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in possibility...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.06,0:23:32.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No smack of doubt or fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.26,0:23:34.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.86,0:23:36.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I hear a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.69,0:23:39.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.45,0:23:39.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.97,0:23:41.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.63,0:23:43.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see inside
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.23,0:23:46.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(the time is right)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.26,0:23:47.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.66,0:23:48.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.21,0:23:51.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All I need,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.20,0:23:49.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.08,0:23:54.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make all this reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.60,0:23:55.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(it's inside)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.90,0:23:57.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The beauty within the shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.57,0:23:58.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(deep within the shell)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.99,0:23:59.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(within the shell)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.97,0:24:01.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.05,0:24:03.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I hear a voice
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.97,0:24:06.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.40,0:24:08.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.56,0:24:07.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.53,0:24:12.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(the time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.75,0:24:10.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.95,0:24:14.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.07,0:24:15.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.37,0:24:16.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.80,0:24:16.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,all I need,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.62,0:24:19.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make all this reality,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.92,0:24:22.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it's inside
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.77,0:24:25.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,right here within the shell.
